# vault domain (ADR-014)
# Offline (no network), persistent secret store. keepassxc is on the vm-agent
# RUN whitelist, a compile-time constant shared by every AppVM for the alpha
# (R130; ADR-021's revision note). A per-manifest whitelist is post-alpha and
# is not a vault blocker.
# qtwayland5: keepassxc is Qt5, and the foundation's GUI runtime is GTK. An
# AppVM's only display is Wayland (through waypipe), and without Qt's wayland
# platform plugin keepassxc falls back to xcb and aborts (ai4, 2026-10-02).
keepassxc
qtwayland5
foot
pcmanfm
